            {
                at 2026-08-08T13:06:19.289713703Z
                author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                kind @decision
                text "H_LOAD selects native decoding only after a positive native header match; libedit and unknown inputs retain the legacy streaming reader, including its truncated-cookie compatibility. Native blobs are ignored because the C seam has no length-bearing owner, embedded-NUL text is rejected rather than truncated, and recoverable good records are entered even when the call reports corruption. H_SAVE remains _HiStOrY_V2_. Verified with focused default/bsd tests, the C-locale matrix, clippy, and a passing nplan check."
            }

