                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @decision
                        text "Acceptance auditing found return-code-only coverage around terminal/tty commands, binding mutations, foreign history effects, and signal handling. Those behaviours are now explicit prerequisite nodes. The four repairs are independent after their existing native-core and ABI dependencies; final acceptance joins them and must observe downstream state, output, callback, and signal effects rather than immediate statuses alone."
                    }
                )
            }

