                        text "Full dispatch depends on two native protocols rather than compatibility-name fallbacks: greenfield-command-sequences owns repeat/next-unit/Vi composition, and greenfield-command-effects owns history, alias, command-input, and external-edit suspension. Final acceptance now joins this node instead of the surface-only binding node."
